  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-04-05T14:25:41.833Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Have the option to be green to favorite friends or put all the others in a perpetual orange status so they need to request to join. \n\nI love my friends but different friend groups don't always mix well together and being able to facilitate some people rather than others joining  on you can make the vrc experience a lot nicer. \n\nAlso another example would be new friends you don't really know joining a group you didn't want them to meet.\n\nI could suggest making an option like \"see my status as\" on or in the friend groups lists/favorite friends lists",
